' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Medium UAF/UPDM view across 2 viewpoint rows (CV-1/SV-1 flavor).
'   usecase:      Teach cross-viewpoint needlines between Strategic and Systems.
'   complexity:   medium
'   domain:       enterprise / defense-architecture
' ============================================================================
title Example UAF/UPDM - Medium Systems View (CV-1 / SV-1)

note as TopNote
  Two viewpoint ROWS on the UAF grid:
  - StrategicVision (CV-1 flavor) top
  - SystemsView (SV-1 flavor) bottom
  Cross-row needline links a vision to a fielded system.
end note

' ---- Row 1: Strategic / Capability Vision (CV-1) ----
package "Strategic x Capabilities" as S_C {
  rectangle "Vision: Persistent ISR" as V1
  rectangle "Capability: Detect Threat" as C1
  rectangle "Capability: Report Fast" as C2
}

' ---- Row 2: Systems View (SV-1) ----
package "Systems x Resources" as SY_R {
  node "Radar System" as N1
  node "C2 Node" as N2
  database "Track DB" as DB1
}

V1 --> C1 : demands
V1 --> C2 : demands

' Cross-viewpoint NEEDLINE: strategic capability to fielded system resource.
C1 ..> N1 : "realized-by (needline)"
C2 ..> N2 : "realized-by (needline)"

N1 --> N2 : track data
N2 --> DB1 : persist
DB1 --> N2 : query
